      "about": "A `declared` object set `long_loans` whose `where` is `in_set('lent') and days > 30`: a call of `in_set` (Appendix B). The vector holds the line, not a lake that declares `lent`.",
      "line": "{\"body\":{\"declaration\":{\"declare\":\"object_set\",\"name\":\"long_loans\",\"of\":\"loan\",\"where\":\"in_set('lent') and days > 30\"},\"kind\":\"declared\",\"version\":1},\"context\":{\"depth\":0,\"origin\":\"direct\"},\"fence\":1,\"hash\":\"eacd3ffb0dc166432bc3770670275d5fbb6da518e7ebc5ace2e3fffc78316b86\",\"id\":\"9d6f2b4a7c1e5f8d3b0a6c2e4f7d1b95\",\"known_at\":\"2026-10-04T08:00:02.000000Z\",\"lake\":\"vectors\",\"origin\":\"authored\",\"position\":25,\"prev\":\"79c0fa1d433469b0ceaf78fac75031102244fd269af46ada50b687aaf6dc1ac2\",\"v\":15,\"writer\":\"agent:agent\"}",
