      "about": "A `migrated` event of `loan` whose migration names a relation's rename, `relation_renames`, from `lent_to` to `borrower`: the relation keeps its edges (§2.3).",
      "line": "{\"body\":{\"kind\":\"migrated\",\"migration\":{\"relation_renames\":[[\"lent_to\",\"borrower\"]],\"to\":{\"field_meta\":true,\"fields\":[{\"authority\":\"authored\",\"name\":\"out_on\",\"on_input_change\":\"keep\",\"required\":false,\"searchable\":false,\"sensitive\":false,\"type\":{\"kind\":\"date_time\"}},{\"authority\":\"authored\",\"name\":\"back_on\",\"on_input_change\":\"keep\",\"required\":false,\"searchable\":false,\"sensitive\":false,\"type\":{\"kind\":\"date_time\"}},{\"authority\":\"derived\",\"depends_on\":[\"out_on\",\"back_on\"],\"derived\":\"floor((back_on - out_on) / 1d)\",\"name\":\"days\",\"on_input_change\":\"keep\",\"required\":false,\"searchable\":false,\"sensitive\":false,\"type\":{\"kind\":\"number\"}}],\"name\":\"loan\",\"relations\":[{\"cardinality\":\"many_to_one\",\"name\":\"borrower\",\"target\":\"loan\"}]}},\"report_id\":\"4f1d0c9b7a6e5d3c2b1a0f9e8d7c6b5a4f3e2d1c0b9a8f7e6d5c4b3a2f1e0d9c\",\"schema_hash\":\"ef357c24258676b46f36e03e65d41c127d312174b77c6e32b9645e5e3032874e\",\"version\":2},\"context\":{\"depth\":0,\"origin\":\"direct\"},\"fence\":1,\"hash\":\"891f2ed1ce8931acd3d2617e0b41dd49036f4292b1ca59ed370ac6682f36cf0b\",\"id\":\"2c8e5a1f7d3b4096a1e5c7d9f0b2a468\",\"known_at\":\"2026-10-04T08:00:03.000000Z\",\"lake\":\"vectors\",\"origin\":\"authored\",\"position\":26,\"prev\":\"eacd3ffb0dc166432bc3770670275d5fbb6da518e7ebc5ace2e3fffc78316b86\",\"v\":15,\"writer\":\"agent:agent\"}",
