      "about": "A `record_upserted` of the `sys.setting` `view_kept.loan_days`, which asks for the view `loan_days` to be kept. It is the setting's first version, so it carries `made`. The vector holds the line, not a lake that declares the view.",
      "line": "{\"body\":{\"key\":\"view_kept.loan_days\",\"kind\":\"record_upserted\",\"made\":true,\"patch\":{\"key\":\"view_kept.loan_days\",\"value\":true},\"type\":\"sys.setting\",\"version\":1},\"context\":{\"depth\":0,\"origin\":\"direct\"},\"fence\":1,\"hash\":\"53ef15cceace2873c5e8998b528367a768a6eb41b093e5e6125bd0a2654a4eff\",\"id\":\"7b1f4e9a2c6d4835b0a7e3c1d5f29b64\",\"known_at\":\"2026-10-05T08:00:00.000000Z\",\"lake\":\"vectors\",\"origin\":\"authored\",\"position\":27,\"prev\":\"891f2ed1ce8931acd3d2617e0b41dd49036f4292b1ca59ed370ac6682f36cf0b\",\"v\":15,\"writer\":\"agent:agent\"}",
