    {
      "shows": "made_again",
      "about": "A `record_upserted` of the `loan` `l1` at `version` 4 that carries `made`: the write found no live record under the key, and a version above 1 says the record was retired before and is made again (§2.3). The vector holds the line, not the three events before it.",
      "line": "{\"body\":{\"key\":\"l1\",\"kind\":\"record_upserted\",\"made\":true,\"patch\":{\"out_on\":\"2026-10-05T09:00:00.000000Z\"},\"type\":\"loan\",\"version\":4},\"context\":{\"depth\":0,\"origin\":\"direct\"},\"fence\":1,\"hash\":\"5750332081ba50402eb808dbb723167dc5b3c0e2ffca35ceac73c4144664bfb1\",\"id\":\"2e8c5a1f9b3d47c6a0f4d7b1c9e35a82\",\"known_at\":\"2026-10-05T09:00:00.000000Z\",\"lake\":\"vectors\",\"origin\":\"authored\",\"position\":28,\"prev\":\"53ef15cceace2873c5e8998b528367a768a6eb41b093e5e6125bd0a2654a4eff\",\"v\":15,\"writer\":\"agent:agent\"}",
