      "about": "A `write_proposed` of an upsert, `pinned`: its proposer's grant admits only some records of `claim`, so its accept is refused once the record or the type changed after it (§2.4).",
      "line": "{\"body\":{\"kind\":\"write_proposed\",\"pinned\":true,\"proposal\":\"p-own-claim\",\"why\":\"my own claim, paid\",\"write\":{\"key\":\"c1\",\"opts\":{},\"patch\":{\"note\":\"paid\"},\"type\":\"claim\",\"write\":\"upsert\"}},\"context\":{\"depth\":0,\"origin\":\"direct\"},\"fence\":1,\"hash\":\"9111f8c64493161dd35af60dd866d057b0c7c5674a296ad196bb883f48d18c79\",\"id\":\"00000000000000000000000000000022\",\"known_at\":\"2026-10-05T09:00:05.000000Z\",\"lake\":\"vectors\",\"origin\":\"authored\",\"position\":34,\"prev\":\"8ab8f6d1495daf691d8b076468a9fe4ee96606125fbd660eabba0c283e27cd41\",\"v\":15,\"writer\":\"agent:alice\"}",
